<p>
  <em>
    What does it mean to be a person —
    to have a body, and live in it —
    to make choices, and change over time – to tell the truth?
  </em>
</p>

<p>
  Re-written and re-performed (different this time)
  by Miriam Suzanne,
  with original music by Teacup Gorilla.
  Directed by Julie Rada.
</p>

